  m_Name: InnerCover
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Left Inner Cover
  description: The Left Inner Cover is a structural component that provides support
    and protection for the engine's internal mechanisms, helping to maintain a stable
    and efficient operating environment. Its position and design allow it to work
    in conjunction with other inner covers to encase and shield the engine's core
    components. One interesting aspect of the Left Inner Cover is its role in facilitating
    airflow and heat management within the engine.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1694ee1e364b71945a65d8c5871258d7, type: 3}
